        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{c^{4}d^{2}}{e^{6}}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\n\\left( \\frac{c^{2}d}{e^{3}} \\right)^{2} &= \\frac{c^{2\\times2}\\,d^{2}}{e^{3\\times2}} \\\\\n&= \\frac{c^{4}d^{2}}{e^{6}}\n\\end{align*}$$",
